# App pages

## Structure

One route per screen under `app/{route}/page.tsx`. Wrap content in `<AppShell>`.

## Client vs server

Use `"use client"` when the page needs `useState`, events, or browser APIs. Prototype pages are mostly client components.

## Layout

- Default content: `max-w-4xl` or `max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 py-6 pb-24` (room for mobile bottom nav)
- Desktop dashboard: pass `aside={<SummaryPanel ... />}` to `AppShell` on `/` only when appropriate

## Navigation

Add new routes to `navItems` in `components/layout/sidebar.tsx` and consider `MobileNavigation` (max 5 bottom tabs — overflow goes to sidebar menu).

## Mock data

Import types and data from `@/lib/mock-data`. When adding state, plan to lift data to context/hook — do not duplicate types in pages.
